  "humanSetupInstructions": [
    "1. Create an empty GameObject 'GameManager' and attach GameManager.cs and UIManager.cs. Assign all UI references in the inspector.",
    "2. Create a 'Pusher' GameObject, add a Rigidbody (isKinematic=true), and attach PusherMovement.cs.",
    "3. Ensure all prefabs mentioned in 'CoinSpawner' (BumperPrefab, CoinPrefab) are assigned in the inspector.",
    "4. Ensure all sound files exist in the 'Resources' folder for SoundManager.cs to work correctly."
